  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the International Year of Rangelands and Pastoralists 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">i.
observe the International Year, as appropriate, through activities aimed at raising awareness and the visibility of and directing attention to the relevance of rangelands and pastoralism.
ii.
recognize sustainable pastoralism as a dynamic and transformative livelihood linked to the diversity of ecosystems, production mechanisms, cultures, identities, traditional knowledge, and historical experiences of coexisting with nature;
iii.
encourage all stakeholders to work towards valuing the pastoral livestock sector, supporting sustainable rangeland management practices and pastoralist participation in governance and decision-making, reducing greenhouse gas emissions while increasing adaptive capacity and resilience, and preserving biodiversity in rangelands; and
iv.
highlight the need for enhanced responsible investment in research and development of rangelands and the pastoral livestock sector to achieve (i), (ii)  (iii) above.</narrative>
  </description>
